<title>GERMANY: Schering says raises 1996 dividend payout.</title>
<headline>Schering says raises 1996 dividend payout.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>    Group net profit (already reported)    362   up 46 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend					 2.00  vs 1.55 marks</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			    211   vs 193</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Schering AG, the German pharmaceuticals group.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
